<title>USA: Little Egg Harbor, N.J., won by Commerce Capital.</title>
<headline>Little Egg Harbor, N.J., won by Commerce Capital.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Commerce Capital said it won $2.913 million of Little Egg Harbor Township, N.J., general improvement bonds, Series 1997, with a net interest cost of 4.89 percent.</p>
</text>
